    "enUS": {
      "description": "A fine egg is one that will, in ideal conditions, hatch free of the evil effects of the Gordunni ogres' incantations.",
      "dialogue": {
        "2fc0b8573c58718a0729": "A fine egg is one that will, in ideal conditions, hatch free of the evil effects of the Gordunni ogres' incantations.",
        "cf4754a96e30f70c8deb": "Very good, $N. I will be sending this egg to Darnassus where I hope it will soon hatch!$B$BPlease accept this as a symbol of my gratitude."
      },
